# 13. Summary of MCP Tools

| Tool             | Operation                          | Circuit remains? |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| `add_gate`       | Gate add karta hai                 | Yes              |
| `remove_gate`    | Specific gate remove karta hai     | Yes              |
| `get_circuit`    | Current circuit retrieve karta hai | Yes              |
| `clear_circuit`  | Saare gates remove karta hai       | Yes              |
| `delete_circuit` | Complete circuit delete karta hai  | No               |

---

# 14. Overall Purpose

`server.js` Quantum Learning Platform ke MCP layer ka entry point hai.

Ye AI/MCP clients ko predefined tools provide karta hai jinke through quantum circuits ko manipulate aur inspect kiya ja sakta hai.

Current implementation ka focus **quantum circuit management** par hai, na ki quantum circuit simulation ya execution par.

The MCP server therefore provides the following capabilities:

```text
Add Gate
Remove Gate
Clear Circuit
Delete Circuit
Get Circuit
```

Ye modular design future me additional circuit operations add karna easy banata hai.
